{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Thunderfall Wand procs on direct magic damage (#11844, #12627, #13173, #12286)",
  "contract": [
    "#11844, #12627, #13173, #12286: Thunderfall Wand (proc dummies 303048, 312845, 316845, 320845) never",
    "procced. Every dummy carries Spell.dbc ProcFlags 0 and the world had no spell_proc row, so",
    "SpellMgr::LoadSpellProcs skipped it. Tooltip: \"magic damage\" (base and the two top tiers) and \"direct magic",
    "damage\" (312845). The narrower direct reading is used, spells only (no wand shots), as Spark of Infernus and",
    "Stormwitch Staff; whether periodic ticks should count is left to the maintainers. No cooldown in any",
    "tooltip. spell_proc_chance reads each loaded entry's chance, which equals the record's ProcChance, and",
    "spell_proc_cooldown_ms reads each loaded cooldown. aura_proc_rate replays the aura's native proc decision,",
    "including the roll, 40000 times on one synthetic event per check. It procs on a landed direct magic spell",
    "(Frostbolt 116), at the record's chance; it never procs on a wand shot (Shoot 5019), a periodic Arcane tick",
    "(Moonfire 8921), a landed melee ability (Heroic Strike 78). Before the repair the chance and cooldown",
    "lookups fail with 'Spell has no proc entry' and every rate reads 0, so the discriminating checks fail",
    "instead of flaking."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
